================================================================================
NAVIGATION ARROWS (collapsed handles->fires->navigates)
================================================================================
  FROM             -> TO               CONTROL/MODE         GUARD
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Bag              -> PromoCode        PromoTap/sheet       
  Bag              -> Shipping         CheckoutTap/push     
  OrderFailed      -> Review           RetryTap/push        
  Payment          -> CardEntry        ContinueTap/sheet    
  Payment          -> ApplePaySheet    ContinueTap/sheet    
  Review           -> OrderFailed      PlaceOrderTap/push   LOCK[NotSubmitting]
  Shipping         -> AddressForm      EditAddressTap/sheet 
  Shipping         -> DeliveryMethod   EditDeliveryTap/sheet 
  Shipping         -> Payment          ContinueTap/push     LOCK[AddressPresent]

RETURN ARROWS (dismiss = thin return to presenter; returnsTo = boundary outcome-branch):
  PromoCode        ~> Bag              ApplyTap (dismiss)
  AddressForm      ~> Shipping         CancelTap (dismiss)
  CardEntry        ~> Payment          SaveTap (dismiss)
  DeliveryMethod   ~> Shipping         ConfirmTap (dismiss)
  ApplePaySheet    ~> Payment          when=cancelled/push (returnsTo)
  ApplePaySheet    ~> Payment          when=failed/push (returnsTo)
  ApplePaySheet    ~> Review           when=success/root (returnsTo)

LEGEND:
  [ X ]    component block (renders edge)   : X xN :  repeat:true
  binds:   StateStores the frame reads-through   writes: mutations it owns (! irreversible)
  ->       navigates    ~>  dismiss/return    LOCK[..]  guard assertion
================================================================================
